{"seq":2,"slug":"minimum-wage","title":"最低工资","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/market-frictions-institutions/minimum-wage","wordCount":3190,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"最低工资\">最低工资</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>最低工资（Minimum Wage）是全球最广泛实施也最具争议的劳动市场政策。截至 2020 年代，全球约 90% 的国家设有法定最低工资制度。围绕最低工资的争论贯穿了一个世纪的经济学研究——它究竟是帮助低收入工人的有效工具，还是牺牲就业机会的适得其反的干预？</p>\n<p>这一争论的核心在于：劳动市场的结构更接近竞争性还是买方垄断性。在完全竞争模型中，将工资强制提高到均衡水平之上必然减少就业；而在买方垄断模型中，适度的最低工资可以同时提高工资<strong>和</strong>就业。哪种模型更贴近现实，是一个实证问题——而实证文献经历了从&quot;显著负效应&quot;到&quot;效果不确定&quot;再到&quot;因语境而异&quot;的演变。</p>\n<p>本文将系统梳理最低工资的理论预测、实证方法的革新、主要发现，以及政策设计中的关键考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>最低工资争论的实质是一场关于劳动市场结构的辩论：竞争性模型预测提高工资必然减少就业，买方垄断模型则允许适度上调同时抬升工资与就业。因此，任何一种最低工资政策的效应评估，都必须先回答&quot;我们面对的究竟是哪种市场结构&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[最低工资上调] --&gt; B{劳动市场结构}&#10;    B --&gt;|竞争性| C[就业下降: 需求曲线上移]&#10;    B --&gt;|买方垄断| D[工资与就业可同时上升]&#10;    C --&gt; E[解雇 / 减少工时 / 削减福利]&#10;    D --&gt; F[压缩买方垄断租金]&#10;    E --&gt; G[净就业效应的实证之争]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[Card-Krueger 自然实验与后续文献]&#10;    H --&gt; I[结论因语境而异]\">graph TD\n    A[最低工资上调] --&gt; B{劳动市场结构}\n    B --&gt;|竞争性| C[就业下降: 需求曲线上移]\n    B --&gt;|买方垄断| D[工资与就业可同时上升]\n    C --&gt; E[解雇 / 减少工时 / 削减福利]\n    D --&gt; F[压缩买方垄断租金]\n    E --&gt; G[净就业效应的实证之争]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[Card-Krueger 自然实验与后续文献]\n    H --&gt; I[结论因语境而异]</pre><p>下表汇总本文的核心概念与制度背景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>政策含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞争性模型</td>\n<td>工资高于均衡即减少就业</td>\n<td>最低工资存在效率代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买方垄断模型</td>\n<td>单一买家压低工资</td>\n<td>适度最低工资可提高工资与就业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Card-Krueger 自然实验</td>\n<td>利用州际政策差识别效应</td>\n<td>挑战了&quot;显著负效应&quot;的传统结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EITC 互补性</td>\n<td>工资补贴与最低工资并用</td>\n<td>兼顾减贫与就业的政策组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传导机制</td>\n<td>价格、利润、工时的调整渠道</td>\n<td>就业未必是唯一吸收冲击的边际</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"理论框架\">理论框架</h2><h3 id=\"竞争性模型的预测\">竞争性模型的预测</h3><p>在完全竞争的劳动市场中，均衡工资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 2: w^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">w^_</span></span> 由供需交点决定。如果最低工资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 13: w\\_{min} &gt; w^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">w\\_{min} &gt; w^_</span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>劳动供给增加至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^s(w_{min})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（更多人想工作）</li>\n<li>劳动需求减少至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^d(w_{min})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（企业雇佣更少）</li>\n<li>产生失业量 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^s(w_{min}) - L^d(w_{min}) &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>就业减少量取决于劳动需求弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Delta L}{L} \\approx \\eta \\cdot \\frac{\\Delta w}{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = -0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>，最低工资上升 10% 将导致相关群体就业下降约 3%。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键假设的质疑\">关键假设的质疑</h3><p>竞争模型的强预测依赖于几个可能不成立的假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>企业是工资的接受者（无定薪权力）</li>\n<li>劳动市场信息完全（所有人知道所有机会）</li>\n<li>劳动力完全流动（无搜寻摩擦）</li>\n<li>工人同质（无效率差异）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"买方垄断模型\">买方垄断模型</h3><p>Manning（2003）的新买方垄断理论认为，由于搜寻摩擦、地理约束和信息不对称，几乎所有劳动市场都存在一定程度的买方垄断力量。此时企业面临向上倾斜的劳动供给曲线。</p>\n<p>在买方垄断中，无最低工资时的均衡为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_m &lt; w^{competitive}, \\quad L_m &lt; L^{competitive}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0691em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>企业压低工资和就业以最大化利润。引入最低工资 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{min} \\in (w_m, w^{competitive})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工资被强制提高（好事）</li>\n<li>劳动供给增加（更多人愿意工作）</li>\n<li>企业的边际劳动成本曲线变平（不再需要为多雇一人给所有人加薪）</li>\n<li>就业<strong>增加</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过竞争性均衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w^{competitive}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，就业才会开始下降。因此存在一个&quot;甜蜜区间&quot;——在此区间内，最低工资既提高工资又不损害就业。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dmp-搜寻模型中的最低工资\">DMP 搜寻模型中的最低工资</h3><p>在搜寻匹配模型中，最低工资的效果更为复杂：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最低工资替代了 Nash 议价中的工人保留工资——当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{min} &gt; (1-\\beta)z + \\beta p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 时约束生效</li>\n<li>企业利润 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p - w_{min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降 → 开设空缺减少 → 市场紧张度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 下降</li>\n<li>但对已就业工人，工资确实提高</li>\n</ul>\n<p>净福利效果取决于参数——特别是工人议价力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是否低于 Hosios 条件中的最优值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实证革命-card-krueger-及其后\">实证革命：Card-Krueger 及其后</h2><h3 id=\"card-krueger-自然实验-1994\">Card-Krueger 自然实验（1994）</h3><p>David Card 和 Alan Krueger 的标志性研究利用了一个自然实验：1992 年 4 月，新泽西州将最低工资从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.25</mn><mtext>提高到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.25 提高到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.25</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提高到</span></span></span></span></span>5.05，而相邻的宾夕法尼亚州保持不变。</p>\n<p><strong>研究设计</strong>：差异中的差异（Difference-in-Differences, DID）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理组：新泽西州的快餐店</li>\n<li>对照组：宾夕法尼东部的快餐店（地理相邻、经济相似）</li>\n<li>时间：政策实施前后各收集一次数据</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核心发现</strong>：最低工资上涨后，新泽西的快餐店就业<strong>没有下降</strong>，甚至略有上升（+2.7 FTE/店，统计上不显著）。</p>\n<p>这一发现颠覆了之前基于时间序列的传统研究结论（Neumark &amp; Wascher, 1992 报告了 -1% 到 -3% 的弹性），引发了持续至今的学术争论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法论争论\">方法论争论</h3><p>Neumark 和 Wascher（2000）对 Card-Krueger 提出批评：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>电话调查数据可能存在测量误差</li>\n<li>使用行政工资单数据后结果变为负</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Card 和 Krueger（2000）回应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 BLS 行政数据重新检验，结果与原始发现一致</li>\n<li>宾夕法尼亚数据中的部分样本异常驱动了 Neumark-Wascher 的不同结论</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"近期文献的发展\">近期文献的发展</h3><p><strong>Cengiz et al.（2019）</strong>——&quot;Bunching&quot; 方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>利用 138 次州级最低工资变动的合成事件</li>\n<li>观察工资分布在新最低工资处的&quot;堆积&quot;（bunching）</li>\n<li>发现：低于新最低工资的岗位减少量 ≈ 高于新最低工资的新增量 → 净就业效应接近零</li>\n<li>但这主要适用于适度幅度的最低工资调整</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dube（2019）综述</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对美国过去 30 年文献的综合评估</li>\n<li>最低工资对总就业的弹性在 -0.04 到 0.00 之间（非常小或为零）</li>\n<li>对于低工资群体的收入，弹性在 +0.1 到 +0.3 之间（显著正效应）</li>\n<li>结论：当前美国最低工资水平下，就业损失小到可以忽略，收入提升显著</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Harasztosi 和 Lindner（2019）</strong>——匈牙利大幅上调：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2001 年匈牙利最低工资上涨 57%（远超美国幅度）</li>\n<li>发现：就业下降约 3%，但大部分调整通过企业利润压缩和价格传导吸收</li>\n<li>暗示：大幅度调整确实有就业成本，但远小于竞争模型预测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最低工资的传导机制\">最低工资的传导机制</h2><p>当最低工资上升时，企业可以通过多种渠道调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调整渠道</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>实证重要性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>减少就业</td>\n<td>裁员或减少招聘</td>\n<td>小且不确定（核心争论焦点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减少工时</td>\n<td>保留工人但减少小时数</td>\n<td>有限证据，效果小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>涨价</td>\n<td>将成本转嫁给消费者</td>\n<td>显著：最低工资上升 10%，价格上升约 0.7%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩利润</td>\n<td>企业吸收成本</td>\n<td>对小企业重要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提高生产率</td>\n<td>加强管理、减少浪费</td>\n<td>&quot;震动效应&quot;（Shock Effect）有限支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩高工资</td>\n<td>减少工资不平等（向上溢出减少）</td>\n<td>有证据表明最低工资压缩了底部分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减少福利</td>\n<td>削减非工资福利（保险、培训等）</td>\n<td>证据有限且混合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Allegretto et al.（2017）的综合分析表明，对于餐饮业（最低工资影响最直接的行业），约 60% 的成本通过涨价传导，30% 通过利润压缩吸收，仅 10% 左右通过就业调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分配效应与贫困减少\">分配效应与贫困减少</h2><h3 id=\"谁受益\">谁受益？</h3><p>最低工资的受益者特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>年龄</strong>：25 岁以下工人受影响最大（但并非所有都是&quot;青少年打工者&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>性别</strong>：女性从业者占比更高（低工资行业女性集中）</li>\n<li><strong>家庭类型</strong>：单亲家庭、双职工低收入家庭受益最大</li>\n<li><strong>种族</strong>：少数族裔工人受影响比例更高</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"减贫效果\">减贫效果</h3><p>最低工资作为减贫工具的有效性取决于：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>受益者是否在贫困家庭中（如果是中产家庭的兼职青少年，则减贫效果差）</li>\n<li>是否存在就业损失抵消</li>\n<li>与 EITC 等税收补贴的互动</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Dube（2019）估计：美国最低工资每上升 10%，贫困率下降约 2-4%。效果存在但不是最精准的减贫工具——EITC（劳动所得税抵免）的目标性更强，因为它直接按家庭收入发放。</p>\n<h3 id=\"最低工资与-eitc-的互补性\">最低工资与 EITC 的互补性</h3><p>Lee 和 Saez（2012）的理论分析表明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在最优税收框架下，最低工资和 EITC 是<strong>互补</strong>而非替代的政策工具</li>\n<li>最低工资通过防止企业&quot;搭便车&quot;（利用 EITC 补贴压低工资）来增强 EITC 的效果</li>\n<li>没有最低工资时，EITC 的部分收益会通过工资压低转移给雇主</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"国际经验\">国际经验</h2><h3 id=\"各国制度差异\">各国制度差异</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>国家/地区</th>\n<th>设定方式</th>\n<th>2023 水平</th>\n<th>占中位工资比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国联邦</td>\n<td>国会立法</td>\n<td>$7.25/时</td>\n<td>~34%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>独立委员会建议</td>\n<td>£10.42/时</td>\n<td>~60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法国</td>\n<td>公式自动调整</td>\n<td>€11.52/时</td>\n<td>~62%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德国</td>\n<td>2015年首次引入</td>\n<td>€12.00/时</td>\n<td>~55%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>各省市自行设定</td>\n<td>差异大（13-25元/时）</td>\n<td>~40-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>韩国</td>\n<td>独立委员会</td>\n<td>₩9,860/时</td>\n<td>~62%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"韩国的-急进式-上调经验\">韩国的&quot;急进式&quot;上调经验</h3><p>2018 年韩国将最低工资一次性上调 16.4%（从 6,470 韩元到 7,530 韩元），两年内累计上涨约 30%。后果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>低工资群体收入显著提高</li>\n<li>但小企业（特别是零售和餐饮）就业明显下降</li>\n<li>政府不得不同步推出大规模就业补贴来缓冲冲击</li>\n<li>2020 年后调整幅度大幅放缓</li>\n</ul>\n<p>启示：<strong>速度和幅度</strong>与最低工资水平同样重要——给予企业充分的调整时间可以大幅减少就业冲击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最优最低工资的理论\">最优最低工资的理论</h2><h3 id=\"lee-saez-框架\">Lee-Saez 框架</h3><p>Lee 和 Saez（2012）在最优税收理论框架下推导最优最低工资：</p>\n<p>如果社会福利函数对低收入者赋予更高权重，且劳动市场存在买方垄断力量，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{min}^* &gt; w^{market}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9857em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最优水平取决于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>社会对低收入者的福利权重</li>\n<li>劳动需求弹性</li>\n<li>买方垄断力量的强度</li>\n<li>与其他再分配政策的互动</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实践中的-拇指规则\">实践中的&quot;拇指规则&quot;</h3><p>OECD 和多数劳动经济学家的共识性建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最低工资占中位工资的 <strong>50-60%</strong> 通常是&quot;安全区间&quot;</li>\n<li>超过 60% 时就业风险显著上升（特别是在低收入地区和行业）</li>\n<li>应建立<strong>独立的、基于证据的调整机制</strong>（如英国的 Low Pay Commission）</li>\n<li>允许地区差异化（生活成本不同的地区设定不同水平）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>最低工资政策的经济学分析已从简单的&quot;供需图&quot;演变为融合市场结构、实证识别和福利分析的复杂领域。核心共识正在形成：在适度水平下（中位工资的 50-60%），最低工资的就业负效应极小或为零，而收入提升效应显著；但大幅度、急速的上调确实存在就业风险，特别是对于小企业和边缘就业群体。</p>\n<p>对于政策实践，最重要的启示是：最低工资不是&quot;要不要&quot;的二元选择，而是&quot;设在哪里、如何调整&quot;的精细化设计问题。独立的评估机制、渐进的调整路径、地区差异化设定，以及与 EITC 等税收政策的协调配合，共同构成了有效的最低工资制度框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><p>最低工资争论的核心是市场结构判断与因果识别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"unions-collective-bargaining\">工会与集体谈判</a>：最低工资与工会是劳动市场两类主要的制度性工资抬升力量，比较两者的就业与分配效应富有启发。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../microeconomics/supply-and-demand/government-intervention-and-price-control\">政府干预与价格管制</a>：最低工资是「价格下限」的典型案例，该篇给出价格管制在竞争市场中的一般福利分析。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../econometrics/causal-inference/difference-in-differences\">双重差分</a>：Card-Krueger 的最低工资实证革命正是双重差分法的奠基性应用，该篇系统讲解 DID 的识别假设与实现。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../public-economics/taxation/principles-efficiency-equity\">税收的效率与公平</a>：本文提到的 EITC 与最低工资的政策协调，需要在公共经济学的再分配与效率框架下权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"最低工资","id":"最低工资"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"理论框架","id":"理论框架"},{"level":3,"text":"竞争性模型的预测","id":"竞争性模型的预测"},{"level":3,"text":"关键假设的质疑","id":"关键假设的质疑"},{"level":3,"text":"买方垄断模型","id":"买方垄断模型"},{"level":3,"text":"DMP 搜寻模型中的最低工资","id":"dmp-搜寻模型中的最低工资"},{"level":2,"text":"实证革命：Card-Krueger 及其后","id":"实证革命-card-krueger-及其后"},{"level":3,"text":"Card-Krueger 自然实验（1994）","id":"card-krueger-自然实验-1994"},{"level":3,"text":"方法论争论","id":"方法论争论"},{"level":3,"text":"近期文献的发展","id":"近期文献的发展"},{"level":2,"text":"最低工资的传导机制","id":"最低工资的传导机制"},{"level":2,"text":"分配效应与贫困减少","id":"分配效应与贫困减少"},{"level":3,"text":"谁受益？","id":"谁受益"},{"level":3,"text":"减贫效果","id":"减贫效果"},{"level":3,"text":"最低工资与 EITC 的互补性","id":"最低工资与-eitc-的互补性"},{"level":2,"text":"国际经验","id":"国际经验"},{"level":3,"text":"各国制度差异","id":"各国制度差异"},{"level":3,"text":"韩国的\"急进式\"上调经验","id":"韩国的-急进式-上调经验"},{"level":2,"text":"最优最低工资的理论","id":"最优最低工资的理论"},{"level":3,"text":"Lee-Saez 框架","id":"lee-saez-框架"},{"level":3,"text":"实践中的\"拇指规则\"","id":"实践中的-拇指规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"搜寻匹配模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/market-frictions-institutions/search-matching-model"},"next":{"title":"工会与集体谈判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/labor-economics/market-frictions-institutions/unions-collective-bargaining"}}